-+### 4. Gate Sign-Off
-+
-+The Sparkle FIM backend implementation in `/tmp/kb-wt-KANBA-70` fully satisfies all architectural, security, performance, and contract requirements of ticket `KANBA-70` (`KB-P5-07`).
